{"ID":"20231025083726-l0len9k","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","icon":"2b50","id":"20231025083726-l0len9k","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231025083726-l0len9k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231025083737-je4py13\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231025083757-qoe8a0i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20231025083737-je4py13\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"素问 · 诊要经终论篇","type":"doc","updated":"20231025083757"},"Children":[{"ID":"20231025083737-je4py13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025083737-je4py13","updated":"20231025083740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"故春刺散俞，及与分理，血出而止。甚者传气，间者环也。"}]},{"ID":"20231025083737-n2wwvo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025083737-n2wwvo7","updated":"20231025083741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"夏刺络俞，见血而止。尽气闭环，痛病必下。"}]},{"ID":"20231025083737-3yx2p2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025083737-3yx2p2m","updated":"20231025083741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"秋刺皮肤循理，上下同法，神变而止。"}]},{"ID":"20231025083737-pciwk0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025083737-pciwk0x","updated":"20231025083742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"冬刺俞窍于分理，甚者直下，间者散下。"}]},{"ID":"20231025083743-wcbcpw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025083743-wcbcpw2"}},{"ID":"20231025083743-f50uq3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025083743-f50uq3w"}},{"ID":"20231025083757-9m05bwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025083757-9m05bwe","updated":"20231025083757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"由于人气与天地之气皆随顺阴阳之升沉，所以春天的刺法，应刺经脉俞穴，及于分肉腠理，使之出血而止，如病比较重的应久留其针，其气传布以后才出针，较轻的可暂留其针，候经气循环一周，就可以出针了。"}]},{"ID":"20231025083757-ulx75mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025083757-ulx75mc","updated":"20231025083757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夏天的刺法，应刺孙络的俞穴，使其出血而止，使邪气尽去，就以手指扪闭其针孔伺其气行一周之顷，凡有痛病，必退下而愈。"}]},{"ID":"20231025083757-lwzmfn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025083757-lwzmfn5","updated":"20231025083757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秋天的刺法应刺皮肤，顺着肌肉之分理而刺，不论上部或下部，同样用这个方法，观察其神色转变而止。"}]},{"ID":"20231025083757-qoe8a0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20231025083757-qoe8a0i","updated":"20231025083757"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冬天的刺法应深取俞窍于分理之间，病重的可直刺深入，较轻的，可或左右上下散布其针，而稍宜缓下。"}]}]}